omaxian-session (1.2.1-1) excalibur; urgency=medium

  * New upstream Omaxian shell v1.2.1 (tag v1.2.1 = main @ 027bd662, "Merge
    pull request #19"). Vendors Omarchy v4.5.0.
  * All nine community-apps now come from their pinned pre-built binaries:
    Folio and Monologue are re-pinned (apps-02b9db3) with QML that loads on
